# Execution Component

Ethereum execution layer client supporting multiple node implementations with RPC operations.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Multi-client detection through metadata service (Geth, Nethermind, Besu, Erigon, Reth)
- Service-based architecture with lifecycle management for modular functionality
- Custom header transport for authentication with execution nodes

## Important Constraints
- Always use context for cancellation in RPC operations
- Fee calculation must include 12.5% buffer for base fee projection
- Service startup must wait for all dependencies before executing callbacks